WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:01.180
What's up guys!

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:01.940
We are Pongfinity

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:04.140
We are back with another episode of Street Battles.

00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:06.500
We have 5 battles with 5 different items.

00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:08.980
If they manage to beat us, they can keep the item.

00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:10.320
Let's see how it goes!

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:15.180
Which item shall I play with?

00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:20.140
Let's go with the American football.

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:23.220
Alright, the American football is tempting.

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:24.620
Okay, let's battle it out!

00:00:38.780 --> 00:00:40.260
This is going to be difficult!

00:00:47.220 --> 00:00:48.660
Slightly too far!

00:00:57.200 --> 00:00:58.680
No chance, 4-0!

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:09.540
I feel that I'm playing well

00:01:09.640 --> 00:01:11.300
But you are simply too good!

00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:20.280
The first mistake!

00:01:20.320 --> 00:01:21.340
Comeback time!

00:01:49.100 --> 00:01:52.100
I would need to start scoring more points if I still want to win!

00:01:52.560 --> 00:01:53.760
Andre Agassi style

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:55.220
I let you make the mistakes

00:01:55.680 --> 00:01:57.140
It seems to be working well!

00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:46.160
You are playing really smart, no mistakes!

00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:58.360
Very well played!

00:02:58.880 --> 00:03:00.860
Here is your prize!

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:01.620
Thank you!

00:03:01.620 --> 00:03:03.160
You lost the best playing item now.

00:03:03.900 --> 00:03:04.400
Yeah!

00:03:04.560 --> 00:03:05.500
Beginner's luck!

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:10.120
No... that was a skillful performance!

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:17.080
Let's take the nerf gun

00:03:18.240 --> 00:03:20.240
That's a great prize.

00:03:22.020 --> 00:03:22.760
Alright, let's go with this!

00:03:23.580 --> 00:03:25.720
I have to figure out how to play with this.

00:03:25.860 --> 00:03:26.640
I'll start serving

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:33.460
I started with my best serve

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:37.780
And that was my worst serve!

00:03:37.780 --> 00:03:39.020
Have to even it out a bit

00:03:41.700 --> 00:03:42.780
What part did that hit?

00:03:48.580 --> 00:03:49.340
1-3

00:03:52.780 --> 00:03:53.300
1-4

00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:05.540
This is not looking good

00:04:05.540 --> 00:04:06.540
What do we play to?

00:04:06.560 --> 00:04:07.360
To 11 points

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:19.180
This isn't working at all!

00:04:19.280 --> 00:04:21.660
I'll have to try out another strategy.

00:04:23.060 --> 00:04:24.020
I'll try this.

00:04:27.280 --> 00:04:29.220
That worked!

00:04:37.620 --> 00:04:38.140
Almost.

00:04:43.220 --> 00:04:45.340
It went all over the place with this one!

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:46.660
11-2.

00:04:46.820 --> 00:04:48.080
That was it! Thanks.

00:04:48.220 --> 00:04:51.360
Here you go, a great toy for you.

00:04:51.440 --> 00:04:53.500
Oh nice, this is great!

00:04:53.640 --> 00:04:55.080
Good luck with the next games!

00:04:55.460 --> 00:04:57.600
Two points. Two points!

00:04:58.540 --> 00:05:00.360
I got humiliated!

00:05:01.160 --> 00:05:03.080
We have to start winning matches guys!

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:08.560
So, three items left.

00:05:09.220 --> 00:05:10.660
What shall we choose?

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:12.960
Something hard, the meat hammer!

00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:15.580
Alright, let's go with the meat hammer!

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:19.920
I'll start

00:05:49.880 --> 00:05:50.380
4-1.

00:06:14.480 --> 00:06:16.240
You went for the hard shot!

00:06:24.640 --> 00:06:25.840
Wasn't too far!

00:06:26.340 --> 00:06:27.960
Okay, I'll have to start playing better

00:06:43.740 --> 00:06:44.940
Ah, can't miss that one!

00:06:48.860 --> 00:06:49.800
Off the net!

00:07:38.220 --> 00:07:39.980
I did this in the army a lot.

00:07:40.740 --> 00:07:43.680
Just put the ball on the table and nobody had a chance.

00:07:59.380 --> 00:08:00.240
10-9.

00:08:15.660 --> 00:08:17.640
Congratulations, well played!

00:08:17.940 --> 00:08:19.020
Here's your prize.

00:08:19.020 --> 00:08:19.800
Lovely!

00:08:19.820 --> 00:08:22.400
Can make some burgers for my girlfriend!

00:08:22.540 --> 00:08:23.680
Sounds good!

00:08:24.780 --> 00:08:27.260
Now we have lost three in a row...

00:08:27.260 --> 00:08:30.580
Alright guys, so I have to win at least one of these two remaining matches.

00:08:30.580 --> 00:08:34.220
And if you haven't subscribed yet, remember to  do it right here!

00:08:38.380 --> 00:08:40.700
Which one do you choose?

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:43.120
This is a sure thing: the teddy bear!

00:08:43.220 --> 00:08:44.620
Okay, the teddy bear!

00:08:44.840 --> 00:08:48.600
Haven't tried playing with this before, we'll see how it goes.

00:08:48.860 --> 00:08:49.700
Let's try it out!

00:08:54.240 --> 00:08:55.480
Strong start

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:04.760
It goes easily over

00:09:13.520 --> 00:09:14.340
Bad touch

00:09:27.320 --> 00:09:28.860
Here we go, 5-4.

00:09:35.540 --> 00:09:37.100
Off the net and over!

00:09:56.000 --> 00:09:58.180
I'll try the last points with the tummy.

00:10:07.380 --> 00:10:08.260
Match point.

00:10:18.620 --> 00:10:19.920
Thank you!

00:10:19.980 --> 00:10:21.760
Another loss for us!

00:10:21.900 --> 00:10:23.620
You won a teddy bear!

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:24.740
That will go to good use!

00:10:24.800 --> 00:10:26.120
Great!

00:10:26.360 --> 00:10:29.580
No can do, this just isn't working for us!

00:10:32.540 --> 00:10:33.460
This is what we have left

00:10:33.460 --> 00:10:36.140
So, you get a mini fan if you beat me.

00:10:36.280 --> 00:10:37.500
Alright, it's good for the Summer!

00:10:41.720 --> 00:10:44.220
That wasn't directly a promising start.

00:11:06.800 --> 00:11:08.080
Good save!

00:11:12.600 --> 00:11:14.040
No, the wind didn't help me

00:11:27.380 --> 00:11:28.360
Wrong way!

00:11:32.180 --> 00:11:33.440
That would have been good!

00:11:50.200 --> 00:11:51.960
I thought that I got that one too!

00:11:59.520 --> 00:12:00.800
10-5, match point!

00:12:04.280 --> 00:12:05.640
And now it starts...

00:12:06.040 --> 00:12:06.680
10-6.

00:12:11.380 --> 00:12:12.520
10-7.

00:12:15.920 --> 00:12:17.900
No way!

00:12:18.100 --> 00:12:21.180
I need to play well now!

00:12:28.680 --> 00:12:29.920
That was intense!

00:12:32.420 --> 00:12:34.000
Thank you!

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:35.660
That was a tight match!

00:12:35.760 --> 00:12:37.120
First win of the day!

00:12:37.120 --> 00:12:38.920
Yeah, our first win!

00:12:38.920 --> 00:12:43.060
But that was such a good game that we will give you the fan!

00:12:43.120 --> 00:12:45.300
Something to keep you cool during the Summer!

00:12:45.320 --> 00:12:47.900
It was a fun match, thanks again!

00:12:47.900 --> 00:12:48.500
Good match!

00:12:48.860 --> 00:12:52.460
Okay, so that proved to be a lot more difficult than we thought.

00:12:53.140 --> 00:12:57.480
Yeah, the items were way harder than in our previous street battles.

00:12:57.520 --> 00:13:00.880
Yeah, and the opponents were really good!

00:13:01.160 --> 00:13:04.760
Leave a comment where you want us to make the next street battle!

00:13:04.760 --> 00:13:07.020
And watch our previous episodes there!

00:13:07.400 --> 00:13:08.240
Until next time!

